Platform card readouts made legible (own code). Two defects on the per-platform
spend cards:

  * The per-model table's Spend and Calls columns ran together ("198.111.8k",
    "0109") and carried no column headers. The gap was declared as
    `.lc-pf-model-spend { padding-left: 10px }` — specificity (0,1,0) — while the
